>MbhC
indro 'ham asmi dharmajña kapoto havyavāḍ ayam | jijñāsamānau dharme tvāṃ yajñavāṭam upāgatau || 28
>MbhS
indro 'ham asmi dharmajña kapoto havyavāḍ ayam | jijñāsamānau dharmaṃ svaṃ imaṃ yajñam upāgatau || 29 ||
>VpŚ2
indro 'ham asmi bhadraṃ te kapoto havyavāhanaḥ || jijñāsamānau tvāṃ rājann imaṃ yajñam upāgatau |
